.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Generated at host startup, not part of the distributed payload. In a RELEASE build the
# engine roots its generated output at the process's current directory, so running the
# demo from this folder drops a .luaurc and a luau-lsp stub tree right here. Untracked and
# unignored, one `git add -A` would commit the whole stub tree into the demo people
# download.
#
# The stale copy is worse than the clutter: luau-lsp loads EVERY .luaurc up the tree and
# the nearest wins, so a frozen stub tree beside the scripts silently becomes what
# `analyze` resolves — passing against an engine surface that no longer exists.
.luaurc
types/
